### Patient API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### 1. 환자 생성 (Create Patient)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "P001",
  "name": "홍길동",
  "sex": "MALE",
  "birth": "19900101",
  "age": "34",
  "phone": "010-1234-5678",
  "zipCode": "06234",
  "address": "서울특별시 강남구 테헤란로 123",
  "addressDetail": "ABC빌딩 4층"
}

### 2. 환자 목록 조회 (Get All Patients)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3. 환자 상세 조회 (Get Patient by ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4. 환자 검색 - 이름으로 (Search Patients by Name)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/search?name=홍길동
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 5. 환자 검색 - 생년월일 범위 (Search Patients by Birth Range)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/search/birth?from=19900101&to=19991231
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 6. 환자 검색 - 성별 (Search Patients by Sex)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/search/sex?sex=MALE
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 7. 환자 정보 수정 (Update Patient)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/1
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "홍길동(수정)",
  "sex": "MALE",
  "birth": "19900101",
  "age": "34",
  "phone": "010-9876-5432",
  "zipCode": "06234",
  "address": "서울특별시 강남구 테헤란로 456",
  "addressDetail": "XYZ빌딩 10층"
}

### 8. 환자 삭제 (Delete Patient)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/1

### 9. 중복 일련번호 체크 (Check Duplicate Serial)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/check-serial/P001
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 10. 환자 생성 - 필수값 누락 (Validation Error)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "",
  "name": "",
  "sex": "",
  "birth": ""
}

### 11. 환자 생성 - 잘못된 성별 (Invalid Sex)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "P002",
  "name": "테스트",
  "sex": "INVALID",
  "birth": "19900101"
}

### 12. 환자 생성 - 잘못된 생년월일 형식 (Invalid Birth Format)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/patients
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "serial": "P003",
  "name": "테스트",
  "sex": "MALE",
  "birth": "1990-01-01"
}

### 13. 존재하지 않는 환자 조회 (Not Found)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/patients/99999
Accept: {{contentType}}
